  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 304.03 Permits-by-Rule",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 304.03 Permits-by-Rule. An owner or operator shall be deemed to have a permit-by-rule if the facility meets the conditions specified in 40 CFR 270.60(a) and (c).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Hw 300) #9362, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12345, eff 8-14-17",
